Package: ruraldefinitions
Type: Package
Title: Data package for accessing and manipulating rural definitions
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Camden", "Blatchly",
      role = "aut"
    ),
    person(
      "Drew", "Rosebush",
      email = "drew.rosebush@ruralinnovation.us",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Aggregates federal rural definitions and makes them accessible
    to R programmers. County-level definitions are included as package data;
    tract-level definitions are loaded from an S3 bucket via get_definition().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Suggests: 
    arrow
